{
  "id": "plos-one",
  "title": "PLOS One",
  "stage": "正式接收前的 provisional Editorial Accept 之后，主文图文件",
  "checked": "2026-11-23",
  "sources": [
    {
      "id": "figures",
      "title": "PLOS One ‧ Figures",
      "url": "https://journals.plos.org/plosone/s/figures",
      "section": "Figure File Requirements, File Format, Dimensions, Resolution, Text within Figures, Color Mode, Additional Requirements for TIFF",
      "fields": [
        "width_mm",
        "height_mm",
        "dpi",
        "font_family",
        "font_pt",
        "output_format",
        "color_mode",
        "bits_per_channel",
        "compression",
        "has_alpha",
        "single_page",
        "flattened",
        "eps_fonts_safe",
        "file_bytes"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "width_mm": 132,
    "font_family": "Arial",
    "font_pt": 9,
    "stroke_pt": 0.7,
    "panel_font_pt": 9,
    "panel_bold": true,
    "output_format": "TIFF",
    "dpi": 600
  },
  "rules": {
    "width_range_mm": [
      66.8,
      190.5
    ],
    "width_targets_mm": [
      132
    ],
    "width_policy": "range",
    "height_max_mm": 222.3,
    "fonts": [
      "Arial",
      "Times",
      "Symbol"
    ],
    "font_policy": "required",
    "font_range_pt": [
      8,
      12
    ],
    "panel_case": "either",
    "formats": [
      "TIFF",
      "EPS"
    ],
    "format_policy": "only",
    "raster_dpi": {
      "default": [
        300,
        600
      ]
    },
    "color_modes": [
      "RGB",
      "GRAYSCALE"
    ],
    "color_policy": "required",
    "rgb_bits_per_channel": 8,
    "tiff": {
      "compression": "LZW",
      "has_alpha": false,
      "flattened": true,
      "single_page": true
    },
    "eps_fonts_safe": true,
    "file_bytes_max": 10000000,
    "single_page": true
  },
  "notes": [
    "规定自 provisional Editorial Accept 后适用。宽 132 mm 可与 PDF 正文栏对齐；许可宽度为 66.8–190.5 mm。",
    "EPS 字体可嵌入或转曲，TIFF 要求 LZW 压缩、扁平、无透明通道、单页。纯矢量 EPS 不用给路径虚构 DPI。",
    "期刊示例允许大写或小写面板。线宽和加粗属于本项目默认值。文件名如 Fig1.tif，图注放在稿件正文。"
  ]
}
